# Kruge, Genesis Seeker (2/2): only attacking Klingons are pumped, so when Kruge attacks alone on turn 3 it grows to
# 3/3 (Bot2 at 17) while the just-cast Gagh Slinger stays 3/2. On turn 5 Gagh blocks Bot2's Blech, Loafing Pest (3/4):
# taking exactly 3 leaves Blech alive; if the trigger had wrongly pumped the non-attacking Gagh to 4/3, Blech would die.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Kruge, Genesis Seeker
Gagh Slinger
Mountain
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Forest
Mox Jet
Blech, Loafing Pest
Island x16

